            "is_free": true,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of easy online football management games? 90 Minute Fever is free-to-play and offers extremely challenging gameplay where you get to compete against others from all over the world!<br><br><strong><u>Retro Artstyle / Classic Playability</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90 Minute Fever pays tribute to football management games from the past offering streamlined gameplay focussed on the things that actually matter!<br><br><strong><u>Manage Live Matches</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our matches are not pre-simulated! You are able to make substitutions, tactical changes and watch the action unfold on the pitch as the matches are fully simulated in real time.<br><br><strong><u>Comprehensive Youth and Training Setup</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handpick which players get promoted from your Youth Academy into your club. Have a hands-on role in their training and watch them flourish into players for your Senior Squad.<br><br><strong><u>Play on Your Own Schedule</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative league system that doesn’t require you to have to login at specific times. Play your league matches live at times that are convenient for you!</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of easy online football management games? 90 Minute Fever is free-to-play and offers extremely challenging gameplay where you get to compete against others from all over the world!<br><br><strong><u>Retro Artstyle / Classic Playability</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90 Minute Fever pays tribute to football management games from the past offering streamlined gameplay focussed on the things that actually matter!<br><br><strong><u>Manage Live Matches</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our matches are not pre-simulated! You are able to make substitutions, tactical changes and watch the action unfold on the pitch as the matches are fully simulated in real time.<br><br><strong><u>Comprehensive Youth and Training Setup</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handpick which players get promoted from your Youth Academy into your club. Have a hands-on role in their training and watch them flourish into players for your Senior Squad.<br><br><strong><u>Play on Your Own Schedule</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative league system that doesn’t require you to have to login at specific times. Play your league matches live at times that are convenient for you!</p>",
